#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:101
msgid ""
"指数控制\"能表示多大的数\"，尾数控制\"能表示多精细的差别\"。FP32 有 23 位尾数，相当于十进制约 7 位有效数字——这意味着它能区分"
" 1.0000001 和 1.0000002 这种微小差异。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:103
msgid "SGD 的噪声掩盖了低位的精度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:105
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"神经网络训练的核心是随机梯度下降（SGD，{ref}`gradient-descent`）。SGD "
"的每一步更新本身就是**有噪声的**——梯度是从一个小批量（Mini-batch）估算出来的，不是全量数据的精确梯度。这个噪声的量级通常在 "
"$10^{-3}$ 到 $10^{-4}$ 左右。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**关键洞察**：FP32 尾数的最后几位编码的变化量级大约是 $10^{-7}$——这个精度比 SGD 的噪声还要小 3-4 "
"个数量级。换句话说，即使你保留了这几位，下一个 SGD 步骤也会把它覆盖掉。**这几位本质上在存\"噪声\"，不是\"信息\"。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:110
msgid "FP32 的 32 位布局：信号与噪声"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:194
msgid ""
"**信息流动直觉**：把 FP32 的 23 位尾数想象成一根 23 厘米的尺子来量一个物体。SGD 告诉我们\"这个物体的大小每次会抖动 ±1 "
"厘米\"——那最后 5 厘米的刻度根本用不上，因为每次量的结果在厘米级就变了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:196
msgid "权重的统计分布"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:198
msgid "神经网络权重的值通常服从某种类正态分布——大部分权重集中在均值附近，极端值很少。这意味着："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:200
msgid "**指数位**用来覆盖分布的宽度（最大值和最小值之间的范围）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:201
msgid "**尾数位**用来分辨分布内部的细微差异"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:203
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"但在实际推断中，把一个权重从 0.5000001 变成 0.5000000，对模型输出的影响微乎其微——{ref}`model-serving-"
"intro`中讨论的\"用户拍照识数\"场景下，用户根本感知不到这个差异。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:205
msgid "实验证据"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:208
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hubara、Courbariaux 等人的 QNN 实验表明{cite}`hubara2018qnn`，在 MNIST 上将权重从 FP32 "
"直接量化为低精度（1-8 位），准确率可与 32 位原版媲美——INT8 "
"量化的误差远小于直觉预期。丢失了数位\"信息\"，准确率几乎未跌。这些被丢弃的位中绝大部分是噪声。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:211
#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:769
msgid "数学表达"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:213
#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:1067
msgid "对称量化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:215
msgid "对称量化将浮点值线性映射到关于零点对称的整数范围。最常见的 INT8 对称量化："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:217
msgid ""
"\n"
"x_{\\text{int}} = "
"\\text{round}\\left(\\frac{x_{\\text{float}}}{s}\\right)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:221
msgid "其中 $s$（scale）是缩放因子，由权重绝对值的最大值决定："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:223
msgid ""
"\n"
"s = \\frac{\\max(|x_{\\text{float}}|)}{127}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:227
msgid "INT8 的表示范围是 $[-128, 127]$，但对称量化关于0对称，实际使用 $[-127, 127]$。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:229
msgid "反量化（Dequantization）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:231
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\hat{x}_{\\text{float}} = x_{\\text{int}} \\cdot s\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:235
msgid ""
"$\\hat{x}_{\\text{float}}$ 是原始值的近似——量化误差就是 $|x_{\\text{float}} - "
"\\hat{x}_{\\text{float}}|$。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:237
msgid "非对称量化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:239
msgid "非对称量化引入零点（zero-point）来处理偏移分布："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:241
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"s &= \\frac{\\max(x_{\\text{float}}) - \\min(x_{\\text{float}})}{255} "
"\\\\[4pt]\n"
"z &= \\text{round}\\left(-\\frac{\\min(x_{\\text{float}})}{s}\\right) "
"\\\\[4pt]\n"
"x_{\\text{int}} &= "
"\\text{round}\\left(\\frac{x_{\\text{float}}}{s}\\right) + z\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:249
msgid "非对称量化更灵活，特别适合 ReLU 激活函数（输出都是非负值，不存在对称分布）。代价是多存储一个零点参数 $z$。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:251
msgid "矩阵乘法的量化加速"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:253
msgid "量化的真正威力在于：INT8 矩阵乘法比 FP32 快得多，而且某些硬件上 INT8 吞吐量是 FP32 的 4 倍。量化后的矩阵乘法："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:255
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Y_{\\text{float}} &= W_{\\text{float}} \\cdot X_{\\text{float}} \\\\\n"
"&\\approx s_W \\cdot s_X \\cdot (W_{\\text{int}} \\cdot X_{\\text{int}})\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:262
msgid ""
"核心计算 $W_{\\text{int}} \\cdot X_{\\text{int}}$ 是整数运算，可以使用更快的 INT8 指令（如 x86"
" 的 VNNI、ARM 的 SDOT）。"
msgstr ""

