#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:765
msgid ""
"**非结构化剪枝**把权重矩阵中绝对值最小的那些元素置零。得到的矩阵是稀疏的——大部分元素为零，但非零元素的位置是不规则的。这种稀疏矩阵在通用硬件上不一定会加速（CPU/GPU"
" 的稠密矩阵乘法有高度优化的 SIMD 指令，稀疏矩阵反而可能更慢）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:767
msgid "**结构化剪枝**成片地删除——可能是整个卷积滤波器、整个通道、或全连接层的整行。删除后，矩阵维度直接缩小，没有稀疏问题，在任何硬件上都能加速。但代价是精度损失更大，因为你是批量地删而不是精细地挑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:771
msgid "基于幅度的非结构化剪枝（Magnitude-based）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:773
msgid "给定权重矩阵 $W$ 和剪枝比例 $p$（比如 30% 的权重被剪掉）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:775
#, python-brace-format
msgid "计算剪枝阈值：$t = \\text{percentile}(|W|, p)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:776
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"生成掩码（Mask）：$M_{ij} = \\begin{cases} 0 & \\text{if } |W_{ij}| < t \\\\ 1 &"
" \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:777
msgid "应用掩码：$W' = W \\odot M$（$\\odot$ 表示逐元素相乘）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:779
msgid ""
"剪枝后的权重矩阵稀疏度约 $p$。被置零的权重在后续微调中有时会\"重新长出\"（梯度更新让它们从零变回非零），所以通常需要多轮迭代：剪枝 → "
"微调 → 再剪枝 → 再微调。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:781
msgid "结构化剪枝（Structured Pruning，以滤波器剪枝为例）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:783
msgid "对于卷积层，每个输出通道由一个滤波器定义。滤波器剪枝的思路是：**删除那些输出激活最\"不活跃\"的滤波器**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:785
msgid "评估滤波器重要性的常用指标是 $\\ell_1$ 范数（L1-norm）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:787
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{importance}(F_k) = \\sum_{c, i, j} |F_k[c, i, j]|\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:791
msgid ""
"$F_k$ 是第 $k$ 个滤波器，$c, i, j$ 遍历其所有元素。$\\ell_1$ "
"范数（L1-norm）越小，该滤波器产生的输出越小，对后续层的影响越小——可以被安全删除。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:793
msgid "什么是 L1 范数，为什么用它？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:796
msgid "**L1 范数**：向量（或张量）所有元素绝对值之和。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:798
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\|\\mathbf{x}\\|_1 = \\sum_{i} |x_i|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:800
#, python-brace-format
msgid "与之对比，L2 范数是平方和的平方根：$\\|\\mathbf{x}\\|_2 = \\sqrt{\\sum_i x_i^2}$。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:802
msgid "**为什么剪枝用 L1 而非 L2？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:811
msgid ""
"L1 范数的核心优势在于它与激活幅度的**线性关系**：如果滤波器 $F_k$ 的所有权重都缩小 10 倍，其 L1 范数也缩小 10 "
"倍，该滤波器产生的输出也大约缩小 10 倍。L2 范数缩小 100 倍（平方效应），会过度放大差异。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:813
msgid "**直觉类比**：评估一个员工的贡献，看的是他\"实际产出\"（L1：绝对值求和），而不是\"产出平方\"（L2）——后者会把一个偶尔加班的人捧上天，而忽略掉那些稳定输出但不出彩的人。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:816
msgid "删除滤波器 $F_k$ 后："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:817
msgid "当前层的输出通道数减少 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:818
msgid "下一层对应位置的输入通道也需要同步删除"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:819
#, python-brace-format
msgid "残差连接（{doc}`../cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net`）的各分支维度必须保持一致，需要额外处理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:821
msgid "这就是为什么结构化剪枝比非结构化剪枝复杂——它涉及到网络结构层面的连锁修改。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:823
msgid "代码实践：PyTorch 剪枝"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:825
msgid "非结构化剪枝（Magnitude-based）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:827
msgid "PyTorch 内置了剪枝工具，可以对单个层进行剪枝："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:829
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import torch\n"
"import torch.nn.utils.prune as prune\n"
"\n"
"# 加载训练好的模型\n"
"model = LeNetMNIST()\n"
"model.load_state_dict(torch.load(\"lenet_mnist.pth\"))\n"
"\n"
"# 对第一个卷积层做非结构化剪枝\n"
"# 删除 30% 绝对值最小的权重\n"
"prune.l1_unstructured(\n"
"    model.conv1,    # 要剪枝的层\n"
"    name=\"weight\",  # 剪枝目标（权重）\n"
"    amount=0.3      # 剪枝比例：30%\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 剪枝后的效果\n"
"# model.conv1.weight 中原先 30% 的值被置零\n"
"# 稀疏度 = 零的个数 / 总参数数\n"
"sparsity = (model.conv1.weight == 0).float().mean().item()\n"
"print(f\"conv1 稀疏度: {sparsity:.1%}\")  # 约 30%\n"
"\n"
"# 对全连接层也进行剪枝\n"
"prune.l1_unstructured(model.fc1, name=\"weight\", amount=0.3)\n"
"prune.l1_unstructured(model.fc2, name=\"weight\", amount=0.3)\n"
"\n"
"# 剪枝后的 mask 存储在 weight_mask 属性中\n"
"# 前向传播时自动应用 mask，被剪掉的权重不参与计算\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:859
msgid "剪枝 mask 是持久的"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:862
msgid ""
"`prune.l1_unstructured` 会将原始权重保存在 `weight_orig` 中，同时创建一个 `weight_mask`。调用"
" `model.parameters()` 时会自动应用 mask。如果想永久移除剪枝（固化结果），使用 "
"`prune.remove(model.conv1, 'weight')`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:865
msgid "全局剪枝（跨层统一比例）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:867
msgid ""
"上面的代码是逐层剪枝——每个层独立删 "
"30%。但不同层对剪枝的敏感度差异很大：浅层卷积通常比深层全连接对剪枝更敏感。全局剪枝让所有层的权重一起参与排序："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:869
msgid ""
"# 全局非结构化剪枝：从整个模型的权重中挑选最不重要的\n"
"parameters_to_prune = [\n"
"    (model.conv1, 'weight'),\n"
"    (model.conv2, 'weight'),\n"
"    (model.fc1, 'weight'),\n"
"    (model.fc2, 'weight'),\n"
"]\n"
"\n"
"prune.global_unstructured(\n"
"    parameters_to_prune,\n"
"    pruning_method=prune.L1Unstructured,\n"
"    amount=0.3,  # 全局 30% 的权重被剪掉（各层分配不同）\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 全局剪枝会自动在各层间分配剪枝比例\n"
"# 对剪枝敏感的层会被剪得更少，不敏感的更多\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:888
msgid "迭代剪枝（更实用）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:890
msgid "一次性剪掉大量权重通常会严重损害精度。实践中更好的做法是迭代剪枝："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:892
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"def iterative_prune(model, train_loader, target_sparsity=0.5,\n"
"                    pruning_steps=5, fine_tune_epochs=1):\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
"    迭代剪枝：每次剪一点 + 微调恢复，循环往复\n"
"\n"
"    参数说明：\n"
"    - target_sparsity: 最终目标稀疏度（50% 的权重被剪掉）\n"
"    - pruning_steps: 分几次迭代到达目标\n"
"    - fine_tune_epochs: 每次剪枝后微调几个 epoch\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
"    import torch.nn.utils.prune as prune\n"
"\n"
"    optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=1e-4)\n"
"\n"
"    # 计算每次迭代的剪枝比例\n"
"    # 例如 50% 目标分 5 步：每次剪 (1 - (1-0.5)^(1/5)) ≈ 13%\n"
"    per_step_amount = 1 - (1 - target_sparsity) ** (1 / pruning_steps)\n"
"    current_sparsity = 0.0\n"
"\n"
"    for step in range(pruning_steps):\n"
"        # 计算这一步还需要剪的比例\n"
"        remaining = 1 - current_sparsity\n"
"        step_amount = per_step_amount * remaining\n"
"\n"
"        # 剪枝\n"
"        for name, module in model.named_modules():\n"
"            if isinstance(module, (torch.nn.Conv2d, torch.nn.Linear)):\n"
"                prune.l1_unstructured(module, name=\"weight\", "
"amount=step_amount)\n"
"\n"
"        current_sparsity += step_amount * (1 - current_sparsity)\n"
"\n"
"        # 微调：让剩余权重适应新的稀疏结构\n"
"        model.train()\n"
"        for epoch in range(fine_tune_epochs):\n"
"            for images, labels in train_loader:\n"
"                optimizer.zero_grad()\n"
"                loss = torch.nn.functional.cross_entropy(model(images), "
"labels)\n"
"                loss.backward()\n"
"                optimizer.step()\n"
"\n"
"        print(f\"Step {step+1}/{pruning_steps}: \"\n"
"              f\"sparsity={current_sparsity:.1%}\")\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:937
msgid "迭代剪枝为什么有效"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:940
msgid ""
"一次性剪 50% 等于\"休克疗法\"——模型突然少了半个大脑。迭代剪枝每次只剪 "
"~13%，然后给模型一个\"恢复期\"（微调），让剩余权重重新分配功能。这和人类学习新技能的过程类似——不是一次性丢掉旧习惯，而是逐步替换。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:943
msgid "结构化剪枝（整通道/整神经元删除）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:945
msgid "PyTorch 也支持结构化剪枝，删除整个通道："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:947
msgid ""
"# 对 conv1 做结构化剪枝：按通道的 L1 范数（L1-norm）排序，删掉 20% 最不重要的通道\n"
"prune.ln_structured(\n"
"    model.conv1,\n"
"    name=\"weight\",\n"
"    amount=0.2,       # 删除 20% 的通道\n"
"    n=1,              # 用 L1 范数（L1-norm）评估重要性\n"
"    dim=0             # dim=0 表示按输出通道剪\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 结构化剪枝后，conv1.weight 的形状会变化\n"
"# 例如 [32, 1, 3, 3] → [26, 1, 3, 3]（删了 6 个输出通道）\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/model-optimization.md:961
msgid "结构化剪枝的连锁反应"
